Short:        SAS/C 6.57 Patch (requires 6.56)
Author:       Steve Krueger (sekruege@mindspring.com)
Uploader:     Steve Krueger (sekruege mindspring com)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This archive contains a number of fixes for the 6.56 version 
of the SAS/C Development System. You should have 6.56 installed 
before applying this patch. This patch will read from the original
6.50 disks, but does not contain all of the 6.55 and 6.56 patches.

The sequence of patches necessary to reach 6.57 is:

Install 6.50 from original disks.
Patch to 6.55 (available on Aminet, sc655pch.lha)
Patch to 6.56 (available on Aminet, sc656pch.lha)
Patch to 6.57 (available on Aminet, sc657pch.lha)

See the read.me file contained in the archive for 
a list of fixes and installation instructions.
